  "description": "FAMDUV crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C76 H84 Cu4 Dy2 N8 O16 2+,2(Cl1 O4 1-),3(C1 H4 O1),H2 O1. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Cu2 (Cu) has 4 O neighbors; Cu4 (Cu) has 3 O neighbors; Cu3 (Cu) has 4 O neighbors; Cu1 (Cu) has 3 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a chain with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.206-3.271 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 88.67-103.19°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy2Cu4(LH)4][ClO4]2·3MeOH·H2O.",
